# Zealthy AI Standards

## Brevity (ADHD/Autism-friendly)

- Keep answers **concise** and implementation-focused.
- Include explanations only when they clarify important trade-offs.
- Prefer short, scannable replies; avoid long preambles.
- Suggest alternatives when relevant (e.g. performance or scalability).
- Default to modern, secure, maintainable code—no short hacks.

## Zealthy color palette

Use these tokens from `src/theme/colors.js` (Tailwind: e.g. `bg-turquoise_surf-500`, `text-primary_scarlet`):

| Token            | Default hex  | Use |
|------------------|-------------|-----|
| turquoise_surf   | `#06aed5`   | Primary accent, links |
| cerulean         | `#086788`   | Secondary, headers |
| bright_amber     | `#f0c808`   | Highlights, CTAs |
| papaya_whip      | `#fff1d0`   | Backgrounds, cards |
| primary_scarlet  | `#dd1c1a`   | Errors, critical actions |

Each has 100–900 shades; prefer semantic names over raw hex in UI code.
